## Active

```dataview
TABLE status, domain, next_action, last_touched
FROM "Projects"
WHERE status = "active"
SORT last_touched DESC
```

## Blocked / Waiting

```dataview
TABLE status, domain, next_action, last_touched
FROM "Projects"
WHERE status = "blocked" OR status = "waiting"
SORT last_touched ASC
```

## Inbox (unsorted)

```dataview
TASK
FROM "_Inbox.md"
WHERE contains(tags, "unsorted")
```

## Everything else

```dataview
TABLE status, domain, last_touched
FROM "Projects"
WHERE status != "active" AND status != "blocked" AND status != "waiting"
SORT last_touched DESC
```